  362|       |   * Version Major, Minor       (2 bytes - major first)
  363|       |   * Units                      (1 byte - 0x00 = none, 0x01 = inch, 0x02 = cm)
  364|       |   * Xdpu                       (2 bytes - dots per unit horizontal)
  365|       |   * Ydpu                       (2 bytes - dots per unit vertical)
